# INVWINF.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the item form from
# the item list.  ENTER shows an item in view mode, which OK and ESC
# close; CTRL+E edits one, where ESC on the unchanged form asks nothing, and
# on a changed one asks first, No keeping the form and Yes leaving it
# unsaved; a change saved by ENTER (OK) shows in the list fetched again,
# its selection on the same row; Record > Next order retitles the frame
# for the next order; the end by Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINF.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S LIST
# item 1 in view mode: its Edit button and OK
K ENTER
S VIEW
K ENTER
S VIEWOK
K ENTER ESC
S VIEWESC
# item 2 in edit mode, the focus on its category; ESC asks nothing
K DOWN CTRL-E
S EDIT
K ESC
S EDITESC
# the category changed: ESC asks, No keeps the form, Yes leaves it
K CTRL-E
T C
K ESC
S ASK
K N
S KEPT
K ESC Y
S LEFT
# the model changed and saved: the list shows it, item 2 selected
K CTRL-E ALT-D
T TM100-4
S TYPED
K ENTER
S SAVED
# the next order retitles the frame
K ALT-C R
S BYLOC
K ALT-F X
